      "rationale": "L1 explicitly names the junction L216\u2013P217 in the S1-S2 extracellular loop of full-length, membrane-anchored Kv4.3. Python lookup confirms residue 216 = L and 217 = P, both within the extracellular span 204-227, \u226512 aa from either TM boundary. L2 confirms no change in channel functional properties; L3 confirms surface detection by immunofluorescence in non-permeabilized cells. This is the best-evidenced site in the ledger. Full-length Kv4.3 (KCND3) expressed in HeLa cells; HA tag (YPYDVPDYA) inserted by site-directed mutagenesis between L216 and P217 in the S1-S2 extracellular loop (topology-confirmed extracellular span 204-227). Construct used in both WT and disease-mutant backgrounds (T352P, M373I, S390N, \u0394F227). Immunofluorescence confirmed plasma membrane trafficking.",
